# Docs Sync Rules

- Before making feature decisions, read `docs/product-brief.md` and stay within MVP scope.
- When making meaningful changes, update `docs/changelog.md` with a new dated bullet describing the why/what changed.
- When architecture or data models change, update `docs/architecture.md` to match the new design.
- Keep documentation concise and focused on what changed or matters for future implementation.
